# Placeholder config for the fleet confirm-gate lint (chrischall/workflows,
# reusable-mcp-ci.yml). NOT credentials — never put one here. The lint starts
# dist/bundle.js with an empty environment and reads its tools/list, but
# src/index.ts requires INSYNC_PORTAL at boot (the portal is per-practice),
# so without this line the server exits before answering and the lint fails
# with "Connection closed". The host must end in insynchcs.com to pass the
# portal check; this one is not a real practice. With only the portal set and
# no credentials the server boots in bridge mode, touches no network at
# startup, and registers every tool.
INSYNC_PORTAL=https://placeholder.insynchcs.com
